       compatibility  purposes,  but  this  can  also  be  replaced  by  using
       EVP_Q_MAC if a library context is required.

       Deprecated low‐level validation functions

       Low‐level validation functions such as DDHH__cchheecckk(3) have been informally
       discouraged  from  use for a long time. Applications should instead use
       the   high‐level   EVP_PKEY    APIs    such    as    EEVVPP__PPKKEEYY__cchheecckk(3),
       EEVVPP__PPKKEEYY__ppaarraamm__cchheecckk(3),                 EEVVPP__PPKKEEYY__ppaarraamm__cchheecckk__qquuiicckk(3),
       EEVVPP__PPKKEEYY__ppuubblliicc__cchheecckk(3),               EEVVPP__PPKKEEYY__ppuubblliicc__cchheecckk__qquuiicckk(3),
