       Deprecated low‐level key exchange functions

       Many  low‐level functions have been informally discouraged from use for
       a long time. Applications should instead use  EEVVPP__PPKKEEYY__ddeerriivvee(3).   See
       EEVVPP__KKEEYYEEXXCCHH--DDHH(7), EEVVPP__KKEEYYEEXXCCHH--EECCDDHH(7) and EEVVPP__KKEEYYEEXXCCHH--XX2255551199(7).

       Deprecated low‐level key generation functions

       Many  low‐level functions have been informally discouraged from use for
       a long time. Applications should  instead  use  EEVVPP__PPKKEEYY__kkeeyyggeenn__iinniitt(3)
       and    EEVVPP__PPKKEEYY__ggeenneerraattee(3)    as    described    in   EEVVPP__PPKKEEYY--DDSSAA(7),
